<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin sets 40-wk T-bill auction for Wed.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin sets 40-wk T-bill auction for Wed.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak Finance Ministry will auction an unspecified tranche of 40-week treasury bills on Wednesday, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the ministry's last successful auction of 40-week T-bills on November 27, the average yield hit 11.249 percent, up from 10.12 percent on November 20.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
